      {
        "_uid": "dcf3bc66-5355-1854-01af-0e8d3eae22ce",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Peter Herdrich said, \"The DLME can only be successful if it attracts the finest institutional partners to collaboratively develop its architecture and content. We are delighted to work with the Aga Khan University as emblematic of a partnership of exemplary insight and wisdom, recognised and deeply respected both in the MENA region and globally.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "He also emphasised on the significance of their presentation for the DLME and the success that has resulted from this event; they were able to introduce their project to so many of their colleagues in the British community and reach a worldwide audience via the webcast. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
