    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The IIS-ISMC Library organised a public lecture about the newly established initiative aiming to preserve cultural heritage from the Middle East. The lecture was coordinated by Dr Walid Ghali, the Head Librarian and was delivered by Dr Charles Henry, president of Council on Library and Information Resources, and Dr Peter Herdrich, co-founder of The Antiquities Coalition.",
